ENTITY SOURCE CONTRACT
The target is a modeled Entity with entity_schema_name, entity_name and modeled Attributes. Logical Mapping uses physical source_objects/source_attributes. Dimensional Mapping uses source_logical_entities entries {logical_entity_schema_name, logical_entity_name} and source_logical_attributes entries adding logical_attribute_name. Use saved schema-qualified Logical keys, including for joins and lookups. Mapping is independent of target registration. Preserve the fixed outer candidate schema.

Logical Mapping may combine physical source_objects/source_attributes with source_logical_entities/source_logical_attributes for peer Logical lookups exposed in the frozen source evidence. Dimensional Mapping uses source_logical_entities/source_logical_attributes for upstream Logical inputs and optional source_dimensional_entities/source_dimensional_attributes for exposed peer Dimensional lookups; physical source fields remain null or absent. Preserve full schema-qualified keys, use unique aliases across source lists, and state precise foreign-key join predicates.
